OL,3,ASudan army drones hit mourners and fuel
OL,4,Amarket killing more than 300 people,
OL,5,Asources say
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Abyei, a disputed border area
OL,8,Fbetween Sudan and South Sudan, 153
OL,9,Fpeople were killed when drones hit a
OL,10,Fmarket on Monday, the region's
OL,11,Finformation minister said.
OL,13,FA military source told the BBC the army
OL,14,Fhad carried out the Abyei attack,
OL,15,Fsaying the market was a fuel supply
OL,16,Fsite for the RSF.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
